sequenceDiagram
  participant Owner as Owner browser
  participant Portal as Portal + Postgres
  participant GitHub as Client Git repository
  participant CI as Client workflow
  participant Site as S3 + CloudFront

  Note over Owner,Portal: Owner confirms Preview or Publish
  Owner->>Portal: Flush latest draft if needed
  Portal-->>Owner: Accepted draft revision + source head
  Owner->>Portal: POST content/publish<br/>kind + expected revision + source head
  Portal->>Portal: Session, tenant, write access<br/>Validate fields and source snapshot
  opt Preview only
    Portal->>GitHub: Reset preview branch to validated live head
  end
  Portal->>GitHub: Commit content.json to selected branch<br/>Reject a changed branch head
  GitHub->>GitHub: Credential and branch policy must allow write
  GitHub-->>Portal: Content commit SHA
  par Client release from branch push
    GitHub-->>CI: Push event at content SHA<br/>main or preview
    CI->>CI: Checks, target selection, site build<br/>Assume AWS role using OIDC
    CI->>Site: S3 upload<br/>CDN invalidation, HTTP smoke
  and Portal submission confirmation
    Portal->>Portal: Record queued publish ID + SHA + kind<br/>Clear or retain draft and advance revision
    Portal-->>Owner: HTTP 202: submission recorded
  end
  Note over CI,Site: Client workflow owns the deployment result
  Owner->>Portal: GET publication status while pending
  Portal->>GitHub: Look up exact SHA + branch + workflow<br/>or recorded run identity
  GitHub-->>Portal: Matching run state, absence, or unavailable
  Portal->>Portal: Persist confirmed progression only
  Portal-->>Owner: Queued / building / preview ready / live / failed<br/>Unconfirmed lookup retains last known state
